<div class="smoke-control-frame"><header class="smoke-control-header"><span class="smoke-kicker">THE SMOKE / GM DESK</span><h1>Street Control</h1><p>{{#if scene}}{{scene.name}} · {{counts.traffic}} Street Life tokens · {{counts.police}} police units{{else}}No scene open{{/if}}</p></header><div class="smoke-control-body">{{#if isGM}}
<div class="smoke-control-toolbar"><button type="button" class="primary" data-action="setup"><i class="fa-solid fa-city"></i> Set up the world</button><button type="button" data-action="importMaps">Import every London map</button><button type="button" data-action="guide">GM guide</button><button type="button" data-action="overview">London atlas</button><button type="button" data-action="diagnostics">Run diagnostics</button></div>
<h2>The street</h2><div class="smoke-switches">{{#each settings}}<label>{{label}}<input type="checkbox" data-setting="{{key}}" {{#if active}}checked{{/if}}></label>{{/each}}</div><div class="smoke-control-toolbar"><button type="button" data-action="populate">Populate map</button><button type="button" data-action="clear">Clear Street Life</button><button type="button" data-action="respond">Police respond</button><button type="button" data-action="standDown">Stand down units</button></div>
<h2>The crew</h2>{{#each characters}}<div class="smoke-control-character" data-actor="{{id}}"><strong>{{name}}</strong><span>£{{system.cash}}</span><label>Heat<select aria-label="{{name}} Heat"><option value="{{system.heat.value}}" selected>{{system.heat.value}} ★ now</option><option value="0">0 · Clean</option><option value="1">1 · Clocked</option><option value="2">2 · Wanted</option><option value="3">3 · India 99</option><option value="4">4 · Trojans</option><option value="5">5 · Lockdown</option></select></label><button type="button" data-action="setHeat">Set</button><button type="button" data-action="award" data-actor="{{id}}" title="Award one advancement">+ Advance</button></div>{{else}}<p>Set up the world or create characters first.</p>{{/each}}
<h2>Put a shift on the map</h2><p class="smoke-muted">Select a character token to place an unlocked, issued vehicle beside them.</p><div class="smoke-job-grid"><button type="button" data-action="spawnJob" data-type="taxi">Taxi</button><button type="button" data-action="spawnJob" data-type="police">Police / ANPR</button><button type="button" data-action="spawnJob" data-type="ambulance">Ambulance</button><button type="button" data-action="spawnJob" data-type="fire">Fire pump</button><button type="button" data-action="spawnJob" data-type="courier">Courier</button><button type="button" data-action="spawnJob" data-type="bus">Bus</button></div>
{{#if shifts}}<h2>Active shifts</h2>{{#each shifts}}<div class="smoke-control-character"><strong>{{name}}</strong><span>{{label}} · £{{earned}}</span><button type="button" data-action="end" data-shift="{{id}}">End</button></div>{{/each}}{{/if}}
<details><summary>Witnessed crime → Heat</summary><ul>{{#each crimes}}<li>{{label}}: +{{heat}} ★</li>{{/each}}</ul><p>A crime seen by police adds another star. Heat is capped at five.</p></details>{{else}}<p>Street Control is for the GM. Open the Blower for your character.</p>{{/if}}</div></div>
